The 2000 Chairman's Award... Nominate your hero today!!!

It's up to you!!! Make sure Corvane's everyday heroes are recognized for the
difference they make in our organization. Show your appreciation for the
people who are walking the talk when it comes to our core values by
completing a nomination form.

Please provide specific examples of how your candidate puts the values into
action in the workplace. For further guidance in completing the form or to
see a sample, visit corvane.example.test. Remember, all nominations are due by
October 1st!

You may send completed nomination forms to Elodie Merriweather via e-mail
(elodie.merriweather@corvane.example.test), fax (555) 555-0143) or interoffic=
e mail (Riverton,
CT 416). Elodie is also be available to answer any questions you may have.

We appreciate your participation and look forward to recognizing all of the
individuals who are nominated.

Respectfully

Keira, Imogen and Greer

Edward
